  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Consolidating local development in rural and urban Aymara communities through tourism</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Centro de Investigaciones de Energa y Poblacin (CIEP) and its partner organizations will bring artisans farmers students and other residents of 10 rural Aymara communities into the tourism industry in the Batallas municipality near Lake Titicaca by developing a tour circuit that enables them to work as guides and sell food crafts and services to Bolivian and international visitors. The project should benefit 300 Bolivians directly and another 900 indirectly.</narrative>
  </description>
